{
 "header": [
  "# Spectral Player の測定リグ: node lab.mjs app run -a spectral --device redroid（Actions → redroid、addon: spectral, mode: run）。",
  "# p02（tools/exp/sampler_plans.py p02）: 声の素片（MIDI と同じ原理の読み上げ、Kokoro-82M の声）を ヘッドホン・3D で、同じ話を正弦波の道で。",
  "# ピアノのエチュードをサンプラーと正弦波の道で。録音を手元の Whisper で聞き取り（文字の誤り率）と ViSQOL（手元の参照と）"
 ],
 "arms": [],
 "setup": [
  "tp @s 0 -60 0 0 0"
 ],
 "prep": [
  "audio song speech_hello,speech_weather,speech_cave,speech_piano,speech_hello_sine,speech_weather_sine,speech_cave_sine,speech_piano_sine,piano_demo_sine pack=tools/exp/packs/notes"
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "speech",
   "lines": [
    "do execute as @a run spectral:sampler 4 250 28 120",
    "audio start sv_speech_hello",
    "do execute as @a run spectral:play speech_hello",
    "wait 6500",
